{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日（11月19日）盛大舉行！每年台慶最備受網民及傳媒矚目的環節，絕對是一眾花旦女星在紅地氈上的爭妍鬥麗。今年全台女藝員再次傾巢而出，以最吸睛、最性感的晚裝造型亮相紅毯。本文將為你緊貼直擊《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈盛況，一網打盡各大視后大熱、一線花旦及新生代小花的絕美打扮！邊個最性感搶鏡？邊個衣著大出事？即睇全場最靚女星造型圖輯及高清相片！</p><figure><img alt=\"羅毓儀（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200142482524999680981470.jpeg/_9hDhCQu07dZEj22h9r_arNMpD2Xg1nVn7LK76myyu8\"/><figcaption>羅毓儀（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳楨怡（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200142479404306432167543.jpeg/KCBZfZ1eGGL_o3uK-9dwLg71LQ3K2MQrVqnML2CpzC8\"/><figcaption>陳楨怡（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳庭欣（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200145007068057600589240.jpeg/23V336PuMVo17gaW1Gtwac4cD1FyvP0IF-72KDLu9ig\"/><figcaption>陳庭欣（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四位應屆港姐。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200145922562985984387692.jpeg/lvcmQHicr4TwsElA_njxVWYNiwDTiNudpc1CCpPNQgo\"/><figcaption>四位應屆港姐。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三位《聲夢》小花。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200147369694334976605379.jpeg/LrxaU8HkfpcYCX59Zcmn4VvcWggMAB6xiHp5sa16ebE\"/><figcaption>三位《聲夢》小花。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200148236116430848018564.jpeg/KTcBgqcutrEfFPCVoD0bdcTN1eYhvQNqJXH7jRNx-40\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200148233834598400871623.jpeg/74371fl37r9S9lgU2HhMu4ZCfXYkrhqGpy7J45EuyeM\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"廖慧儀（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200149595145900032781953.jpeg/B_1BUgII3FYNqwDXFnWav5qKJoj7o4Owntlya57Zcms\"/><figcaption>廖慧儀（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/120014823126755328058